    "detailed_description": "At least 7 Months in the making, the elusive PHIJKCHU Quest is here to change everything.<br>Finally an RPG where you can make the choices that matter in ways that matter.<br>Finally an RPG with multiple Funny's.<br>Finally a Quest... of PHIJKCHU.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2080960/extras/73edaef5b8d204237939d406ff14bdaf.avif?t=1725333994\" /></div><br>^ picture of Rusp and his friends! (some of them are not really friends but for the sake of clarity they can basically be considered friends (within reason))<br><br><br>Join the questionably heroic protagonist Rusp and his gang on the quest to go on a quest. <br>Meet many exciting and normal foes &amp; friends as you explore gamemode after gamemode, map after map, song after song, all unified by a genre hallmark RPG engine handbaked by our skilled programmer.<br><br>Defining Features!!<br>&gt; Over 2 hours of gameplay<br>&gt; Walking engine<br>&gt; RPG Engine<br>&gt; Music<br>&gt; Sound effects<br>&gt; Graphics<br>&gt; Animated sprites<br>&gt; Skill system (vaguely)!<br>&gt; Naval Combat<br>&gt; Various Minigames!!<br>&gt; and...<br>&gt; more...",
